## Negative controls

Each isolated modified copy of the saved script exited 1 with `ASSERT FAIL`.

1. Replaced the asserted manifest sentence with a false sentence: failed the
   lockfile assertion.
2. Replaced the expected publish assignment location with line 999: failed the
   exact assignment-site assertion.
3. Directed the publish-flag absence assertion at the package-help file: failed
   because `--exclude-lockfile` was unexpectedly present.

